"Connie is Alden Thorn's wayward aunt, found by social services after his parents died."
"Alden has lived with her since he was eleven, and he is in effect the grown-up of the two."
"She has bleached hair and an unconventional parenting style."
"She works at a salon at the moment, throws parties and is often late."
"Her friends José and Rhonda work with her at the salon."
"When Alden screamed at night she took eight seconds to respond; he timed it."
"She keeps the Flat Stuff Place drawers."
"She keeps a huge pile of magazines bought from checkout lines."
"Her living room carpet has mysterious stains."
"She leaves Alden alone, sometimes for a week, and once nearly lost him to foster care that way."
"She went to California with a friend and left Alden a note."
"After one guest the cat food went missing and tiger-striped boxer shorts were left behind."
"She can't keep a secret more than two days and wouldn't notice for weeks if Alden quit school."
"She brings double-sausage pizza and plays video games with Alden's friends."
"She is enthusiastic about Alden's new diet."
"She claimed to dry-clean Alden's dress shirt, but not the one that fits."
"When the System chose Alden she stopped being his legal guardian."
"The night before Alden affixed she was out drinking with friends, and was hungover Sunday."
"Alden plans to give her some of his money, maybe a house."
"While Alden was presumed dead she kept his stuffed wombat Wummy on her dresser."
"She is his mother's much younger sister and has blue eyes like hers."
"She left a Tennessee trailer park at sixteen; she turned thirty-three while Alden was away."
"She is dating Brodie, an RV salesman Alden calls Mr. Tiger Shorts."
"She visited Alden on Anesidora, refused his money and urged him to carry pepper spray."
"Her full name is Connie Hatcher."
"While Alden was missing she tore out the stained hall carpet and began mopping twice a week."
"In the Matadero crisis Alden prioritized her evacuation, and Healer Rynez-yt came to fetch her."
"She keeps family things in a storage unit, including her grandfather's antlers."
"Brodie has an engagement ring for her; she told Alden he may drop her from his list of two."
"By December 2040 she is engaged to marry Brodie."
"She wants a small wedding whenever Alden can come, and is taking new cosmetology classes."
"She was Alden's one approved day visitor on Anesidora on December 28, 2040."
